# XBCD 0.2.6 - A LOCAL REFERENCE, DELIBERATELY NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY.
#
# This folder holds the original XBCD source, kept on disk as the datasheet
# for the pad's 20-byte packet format. It is copyright 2005 Helder Acevedo
# under the GNU GPL, version 2 or later.
#
# It is never compiled, never linked and never shipped, and no XBCD code
# appears in XBOXCTL - only facts taken from it: packet offsets, register
# values and protocol constants.
#
# Everything here is ignored except this file, so the folder keeps its
# explanation without its contents being committed. To read the reference,
# fetch XBCD 0.2.6 yourself and unpack it here.

*
!.gitignore
